{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When finding the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/3235e371cde8bfb88ee4d8c19fb8fd156ba646d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"188\" height=\"37\" />, the least common denominator used is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48e30155a95ee92c1aebd2c0ae16f1104d964667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 120 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 210 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 420 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 840 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5040$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The least common denominator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3fbc5445c09d04a6608f5445a795ec2e353485e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{lcm}(2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7) = \\mathrm{lcm}(2, 3, 2^2, 5, 2\\cdot 3, 7) = 2^2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5 \\cdot 7 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"535\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\